WEBVTT

01:27.825 --> 01:28.825
LOVE & CROWN

01:28.905 --> 01:31.025
ADAPTED FROM THE NOVEL "MY QUEEN"
BY XIE LOUNAN

01:31.105 --> 01:34.025
EPISODE 25

01:35.985 --> 01:36.865
You may go.

01:39.225 --> 01:40.065
I don't like you.

01:43.185 --> 01:44.625
It's fine if
Your Highness doesn't care for me.

01:45.585 --> 01:47.305
But before Commander Li left,

01:47.385 --> 01:48.985
he asked me to bring you a message.

01:49.065 --> 01:50.385
Would you like to hear it?

01:51.065 --> 01:52.145
What is it?

01:52.665 --> 01:53.865
Commander Li told me to remind you that

01:54.465 --> 01:56.265
as long as you keep calm,
don't hit anyone,

01:56.345 --> 01:58.145
and behave yourself,

01:58.225 --> 02:00.745
the flower will soon be in bloom.

02:00.825 --> 02:02.905
-That's not right.
-Your Highness.

02:03.865 --> 02:06.585
That is indeed Commander Li's message.
What's wrong with it?

02:06.665 --> 02:08.425
You didn't say it

02:10.185 --> 02:12.105
as nicely as he did.

02:15.105 --> 02:16.425
Then, Your Highness,

02:17.185 --> 02:18.025
about this meal…

02:20.145 --> 02:21.065
I'll behave.

02:21.745 --> 02:22.625
I'll eat it.

02:23.145 --> 02:25.225
Her Majesty arrives!

02:26.185 --> 02:27.465
-Your Majesty!
-Your Majesty!

02:27.545 --> 02:28.585
What brings you here?

02:29.185 --> 02:30.345
I came out for some air,

02:30.425 --> 02:31.465
and thought I'd stop by to check on you.

02:33.225 --> 02:35.345
I'm here now. Dismissed.

02:35.425 --> 02:36.385
Yes.

02:42.345 --> 02:43.825
I know why you've come.

02:44.625 --> 02:45.945
You were afraid I'd be angry.

02:47.025 --> 02:50.905
Don't worry.
I was a little angry just now,

02:50.985 --> 02:51.985
but I've already forgiven you.

02:54.025 --> 02:55.065
Forgiven us?

02:56.225 --> 02:57.265
Why?

02:58.425 --> 03:00.105
It's a secret. I'm not telling you.

03:01.385 --> 03:03.105
It seems our Princess Ying has

03:03.185 --> 03:05.825
grown more poised and gracious,
and far more considerate.

03:05.905 --> 03:07.705
When will Hongqing be able to return?

03:12.985 --> 03:14.385
Well, I don't know either.

03:16.105 --> 03:17.145
However,

03:17.745 --> 03:19.385
I believe that as long as you behave,

03:19.985 --> 03:21.025
and wait for Commander Li's return,

03:21.105 --> 03:23.345
His Majesty will
surely have a surprise for you.

03:24.945 --> 03:26.465
All right. I'll trust you.

03:27.065 --> 03:28.505
Of course you should trust me.

03:31.265 --> 03:32.225
Oh, Your Majesty,

03:32.905 --> 03:35.025
if I receive a gift from Hongqing,

03:35.785 --> 03:37.145
shouldn't I send one in return?

03:38.305 --> 03:39.145
Naturally.

03:39.745 --> 03:41.625
What gift in this world is the best?

03:42.985 --> 03:46.105
In this world,
there is no such thing as the "best" gift.

03:46.625 --> 03:50.025
As long as your heart is in it,
that makes it the best.

03:50.745 --> 03:52.105
My heart…

03:53.985 --> 03:55.545
Does it mean

03:55.625 --> 03:57.665
a gift made with my
own hands would be better?

03:59.945 --> 04:00.785
Yes.

04:03.585 --> 04:04.905
I know what I want to give him.

04:07.705 --> 04:08.705
So,

04:08.785 --> 04:10.065
Princess Ying summoned

04:10.145 --> 04:12.665
the palace maid who
sent Li Hongqing that sachet,

04:12.745 --> 04:14.865
and she could learn
how to make one herself.

04:14.945 --> 04:15.985
Yes.

04:17.184 --> 04:19.944
My younger sister has always held grudges.

04:20.025 --> 04:22.105
It is no small feat for her
to come this far.

04:22.184 --> 04:23.345
Indeed.

04:23.985 --> 04:26.505
I wonder if things are going
smoothly on Li Hongqing's side.

04:28.425 --> 04:30.465
Hongqing has always been meticulous.

04:30.545 --> 04:31.705
Put your mind at ease.

04:32.785 --> 04:34.145
I just hope they all return safely.

04:38.705 --> 04:39.985
But truth be told,

04:40.545 --> 04:42.105
this sachet is quite ugly.

04:47.385 --> 04:48.585
Actually, Princess Ying hasn't finished

04:48.665 --> 04:51.345
making the sachet
she intends for Li Hongqing.

04:51.425 --> 04:55.625
This is the one I made for Your Majesty.

05:02.905 --> 05:06.465
I came to ask what kind of fragrance
you'd prefer.

05:07.065 --> 05:10.225
But since Your Majesty dislikes it,
then I'll take it back.

05:12.345 --> 05:13.385
Why would I dislike it?

05:15.425 --> 05:17.425
I only glanced at it
and missed the details.

05:18.025 --> 05:19.505
With a closer look,

05:20.185 --> 05:21.665
your hands are as skilled as ever.

05:22.265 --> 05:24.825
Your stitching could
rival the palace embroiderers.

05:27.545 --> 05:29.545
-Do you mean that?
-Of course.

05:29.625 --> 05:31.665
I… I like it a great deal.

05:33.505 --> 05:34.625
Glad to hear that.

05:47.025 --> 05:49.865
Our little princess has given her heart

05:50.585 --> 05:52.185
to Li Hongqing,

05:53.985 --> 05:55.905
and is still waiting
for the flower to bloom.

05:57.505 --> 05:58.665
And yet,

05:59.345 --> 06:01.465
will she be met with joy or grief?

06:05.585 --> 06:06.505
What are you getting at?

06:10.065 --> 06:11.385
Working with that man

06:13.345 --> 06:14.945
is like playing with fire.

06:16.905 --> 06:20.625
To him, you are nothing
but a piece on the board.

06:21.425 --> 06:22.425
So,

06:23.185 --> 06:24.185
does that trouble you?

06:27.185 --> 06:29.025
A piece can be played or tossed aside.

06:30.905 --> 06:32.025
Madam, all I want is for you

06:32.705 --> 06:34.345
to live freely, without chains,

06:35.105 --> 06:36.025
not bound to anyone's will.

06:36.625 --> 06:38.025
I know what you're saying.

06:39.985 --> 06:42.185
But there's something important

06:43.265 --> 06:44.105
I need to tell you.

06:45.785 --> 06:46.825
What is it?

06:48.505 --> 06:50.105
The important thing

06:51.065 --> 06:52.625
is that you're still calling me "Madam."

06:58.625 --> 06:59.745
I…

07:00.905 --> 07:02.585
I'm simply used to it.

07:03.625 --> 07:05.145
It's hard to change this habit.

07:08.945 --> 07:10.865
Very well. Suit yourself.

07:18.745 --> 07:19.865
Some incense

07:20.505 --> 07:22.305
can quiet the mind, soothe the spirit.

07:23.185 --> 07:25.865
Others can steal a life without a sound.

07:29.465 --> 07:32.505
Do you think the Lingbi Sect
is capable of taking Li Hongqing's life?

08:49.785 --> 08:50.985
-Help him.
-Yes.

08:55.865 --> 08:57.065
It's a trap.

09:14.985 --> 09:15.825
Go!

09:20.825 --> 09:21.705
Go on ahead.

09:21.785 --> 09:22.745
Quit talking.

09:23.385 --> 09:24.585
You're Li Hongqing.

09:25.385 --> 09:26.425
And what of it?

09:26.505 --> 09:27.625
I've been expecting you!

09:54.425 --> 09:56.265
-It's you!
-Save it, just move!

10:24.625 --> 10:26.305
There are too many pursuers.

10:26.385 --> 10:27.385
We need a distraction.

10:28.185 --> 10:29.025
Luo Xianxue,

10:30.105 --> 10:31.065
I'm entrusting Shi Yan to you.

10:32.345 --> 10:33.225
Why trust me?

10:33.905 --> 10:35.465
You chose to save us.

10:35.545 --> 10:36.745
You'd already made your decision.

10:37.345 --> 10:39.265
Get him out of here. Head for the Capital.

10:39.345 --> 10:41.585
Tell His Majesty and the Empress
about the Lingbi Sect.

10:45.825 --> 10:47.945
Don't worry. I won't die.

10:51.145 --> 10:52.425
Someone is waiting for my return.

10:54.545 --> 10:55.385
Be careful.

12:54.745 --> 12:55.865
When it blooms,

12:56.745 --> 12:59.585
we'll wander through mountains and rivers

13:00.545 --> 13:01.625
to see the sea of blossoms.

13:27.665 --> 13:28.825
Your Highness.

13:28.905 --> 13:31.025
Is there news of Hongqing?

13:31.105 --> 13:31.945
Your Highness,

13:32.025 --> 13:33.545
your dinner from the Imperial Kitchens.

13:48.825 --> 13:52.345
Hongqing said I mustn't bully the weak.

13:53.185 --> 13:54.585
Otherwise, he wouldn't like me anymore.

13:55.185 --> 13:57.425
Then, allow me to help Your Highness dine.

13:57.505 --> 13:58.985
I'm not eating.

14:00.945 --> 14:01.825
I'm going to His Majesty.

14:04.065 --> 14:05.265
You are not to follow me.

14:14.105 --> 14:15.985
Your Majesty! Your Majesty!

14:16.505 --> 14:17.705
Your Majesty!

14:18.985 --> 14:20.025
What now?

14:32.745 --> 14:34.025
This is…

14:34.105 --> 14:35.385
Li Hongqing's sword.

14:35.465 --> 14:37.665
To save General Shi Yan,

14:37.745 --> 14:39.945
Commander Li lured
the Lingbi Sect's elites away

14:40.025 --> 14:40.985
and fell off the cliff to his death.

14:41.065 --> 14:42.185
What?

14:43.665 --> 14:44.705
Did they recover his body?

14:45.305 --> 14:47.025
They searched for
two full days and nights.

14:47.625 --> 14:50.185
All they found was his sword.

14:50.265 --> 14:51.705
How could this be…

14:51.785 --> 14:53.105
General Shi Yan said

14:53.185 --> 14:55.625
the Lingbi Sect
seemed prepared from the start.

14:55.705 --> 14:56.545
They set up an ambush.

14:57.265 --> 14:59.625
If not for Luo Xianxue,

14:59.705 --> 15:02.465
they would've all died there.

15:02.545 --> 15:03.705
Luo Xianxue…

15:04.945 --> 15:06.345
Shi Yan must not give up.

15:06.425 --> 15:08.145
He must keep searching for Li Hongqing.

15:08.225 --> 15:09.625
As long as there is no body,

15:09.705 --> 15:11.865
Li Hongqing isn't dead yet.

15:11.945 --> 15:13.505
-Yes.
-Wait.

15:15.505 --> 15:18.305
Princess Ying must never find out.

15:19.105 --> 15:20.145
-Yes.
-What can't I know?

15:20.825 --> 15:22.225
I heard everything.

15:22.825 --> 15:24.385
Is Hongqing dead?

15:30.425 --> 15:31.425
Xiao Ying…

15:31.505 --> 15:33.785
-Listen to me.
-Did you send Hongqing out there?

15:34.585 --> 15:36.385
You never liked him,
so you sent him away on purpose.

15:36.985 --> 15:38.105
You just wanted him gone!

15:39.025 --> 15:40.665
-That's not true.
-Don't touch me!

15:41.705 --> 15:43.585
You're the one who killed him.

15:44.305 --> 15:45.785
I will never

15:46.745 --> 15:48.505
forgive you!

15:52.305 --> 15:53.465
Your Highness!

15:54.865 --> 15:56.945
Your Majesty, what should we do?

15:57.025 --> 15:59.665
When she loses her temper,
there's no telling what she'll do.

15:59.745 --> 16:02.025
Summon the Prince of Yuzhang here.

16:02.825 --> 16:03.905
As you wish.

16:04.425 --> 16:07.065
-Princess Ying!
-Princess Ying!

16:07.145 --> 16:07.985
-Your Highness.
-Princess Ying!

16:08.065 --> 16:09.585
-Where is the princess?
-Princess Ying!

16:09.665 --> 16:10.505
-Your Highness,
-Princess Ying!

16:10.585 --> 16:13.185
Princess Ying returned an hour ago.
She looked terribly upset.

16:13.265 --> 16:14.505
And then she vanished.

16:14.585 --> 16:15.745
-A bunch of fools.
-Princess Ying!

16:15.825 --> 16:17.945
-Search over there with me!
-Yes!

16:18.785 --> 16:20.225
-Princess Ying!
-This way!

16:20.305 --> 16:21.345
You, search there!

16:21.425 --> 16:22.305
Princess Ying!

16:22.385 --> 16:23.505
Princess Ying, where are you?

16:51.705 --> 16:52.745
Ying.

16:53.865 --> 16:54.985
Ying.

17:05.345 --> 17:06.424
Ying.

17:06.944 --> 17:08.505
What kind of flower is this?

17:09.065 --> 17:10.424
Let me see it, will you?

17:14.905 --> 17:15.785
Qianqing.

17:17.505 --> 17:18.545
Come.

17:30.945 --> 17:33.385
Ying. It's all right.

17:33.465 --> 17:36.265
I will plant it for you.
I promise it'll be just the same.

17:36.345 --> 17:37.425
It will bloom, I swear.

17:38.025 --> 17:38.865
I can't get angry.

17:38.945 --> 17:40.185
I can't hit or scold anyone.

17:40.265 --> 17:42.225
Or else Hongqing won't like me anymore.

17:42.825 --> 17:43.865
-Ying, stop it.
-I can't get angry.

17:43.945 --> 17:45.145
I can't hit or scold anyone.

17:45.225 --> 17:47.345
Or else Hongqing won't like me anymore.

17:51.665 --> 17:53.625
But I can't hold it in. What do I do?

17:56.625 --> 17:57.545
Get out!

17:58.065 --> 17:59.385
I want you to leave!

18:12.945 --> 18:14.825
I can't get angry.

18:16.465 --> 18:18.225
I mustn't get angry.

18:19.265 --> 18:20.625
If I get angry,

18:20.705 --> 18:22.585
the flower won't bloom.

18:24.065 --> 18:25.545
I can't get angry.

18:26.745 --> 18:28.345
I mustn't get angry.

18:29.665 --> 18:31.225
If I get angry,

18:31.305 --> 18:32.625
the flower won't bloom.

18:36.145 --> 18:37.665
I can't get angry…

18:40.265 --> 18:42.065
Li Hongqing isn't coming back.

18:43.585 --> 18:46.145
You and Li Hongqing
bought tanghulu in the market.

18:46.225 --> 18:47.865
He bought this pot of flowers for you.

18:47.945 --> 18:50.105
It's actually a Blaze Blossom.

18:50.185 --> 18:53.145
When it blooms, it's brilliant.
A symbol of freedom.

18:53.745 --> 18:55.985
He hoped you'd
always live happy and unbound.

18:57.945 --> 19:00.425
He put his heart into
everything he did for you.

19:00.505 --> 19:02.425
Stop talking.

19:04.105 --> 19:05.305
I'm not angry.

19:06.425 --> 19:07.745
I can't get angry.

19:08.305 --> 19:09.585
I mustn't get angry.

19:11.905 --> 19:13.465
You've tended to this flower so carefully,

19:13.545 --> 19:14.465
waiting for it to bloom,

19:14.545 --> 19:17.025
hoping he'd see it when he came back.

19:17.105 --> 19:18.065
Isn't that right?

19:18.145 --> 19:20.545
If I get angry,
Hongqing won't like me anymore.

19:21.145 --> 19:23.105
-I can't be angry.
-Li Hongqing is dead.

19:24.745 --> 19:26.265
Even if the flower blooms,

19:26.345 --> 19:28.345
there's no one left to cherish you.

19:35.145 --> 19:36.465
You're lying!

19:37.745 --> 19:39.425
Hongqing won't die.

19:42.025 --> 19:43.345
He won't.

19:43.425 --> 19:46.385
He's dead.
And it was His Majesty who killed him.

19:46.985 --> 19:48.385
-I didn't think anything of the sort…
-You want to kill him.

19:48.465 --> 19:49.505
Stop talking.

19:49.585 --> 19:51.185
-Be quiet.
-You want to kill him.

19:51.265 --> 19:53.185
-I wasn't thinking that!
-Kill him.

19:53.265 --> 19:54.185
Kill him!

19:54.945 --> 19:56.505
Kill His Majesty!

19:56.585 --> 19:58.705
Avenge your dear Hongqing!

19:58.785 --> 20:00.385
Kill His Majesty!

20:00.465 --> 20:02.465
Avenge your dear Hongqing!

20:13.345 --> 20:14.745
I'm going to kill him.

20:16.905 --> 20:17.905
He must die.

20:20.345 --> 20:22.265
I must avenge Hongqing.

20:24.585 --> 20:25.465
I must kill him.

21:03.705 --> 21:06.785
I thought Your Majesty
was about to remove the cloak

21:06.865 --> 21:07.785
and drape it over me.

21:08.465 --> 21:09.665
Why haven't you returned home?

21:10.585 --> 21:11.505
Worried about Ying?

21:13.025 --> 21:15.265
Lately, my right eyelid keeps twitching.

21:16.025 --> 21:17.385
Something isn't sitting right in my heart.

21:23.225 --> 21:25.145
This is the only jug of wine I have left.

21:25.905 --> 21:28.465
I was hoping it'd last me till morning.

21:33.585 --> 21:36.265
Don't be late
for tomorrow's court session.

21:37.625 --> 21:40.145
Minister Xing will be presenting
the waterworks funding proposal.

21:40.665 --> 21:41.905
I'll need your support.

21:45.585 --> 21:47.905
Do you intend to work me to the bone,

21:47.985 --> 21:48.985
and have me serve till death?

21:49.585 --> 21:51.025
It's for the sake of Great Qi.

21:56.705 --> 21:58.105
Here, Prince of Yuzhang.

22:00.425 --> 22:01.585
You've done well.

22:15.105 --> 22:16.785
I only have one younger sister.

22:17.705 --> 22:19.625
She may be a little wild,

22:20.705 --> 22:22.065
but she's the apple of my eye.

22:23.185 --> 22:24.305
I understand.

22:25.465 --> 22:26.705
I haven't given up on Li Hongqing.

22:27.745 --> 22:28.865
I believe

22:28.945 --> 22:30.945
he won't meet his demise so easily.

22:33.985 --> 22:35.305
-Wufu.
-Yes.

22:35.385 --> 22:37.065
Prepare a brazier for
the Prince of Yuzhang.

22:37.145 --> 22:38.185
At once.

23:12.345 --> 23:13.385
Ying.

23:18.065 --> 23:19.785
Why won't you come in?

23:27.585 --> 23:28.945
I wouldn't dare.

23:29.985 --> 23:31.545
You said no one was allowed inside.

23:32.705 --> 23:35.265
I couldn't bear the consequences

23:35.345 --> 23:36.745
of invoking your anger.

23:40.705 --> 23:41.705
I'm fine now.

23:44.665 --> 23:45.705
Truly?

23:53.705 --> 23:54.865
Ying.

23:55.905 --> 23:57.225
I promise you

23:58.145 --> 23:59.945
that Li Hongqing will be all right.

24:00.905 --> 24:02.425
And the flower will bloom.

24:03.705 --> 24:06.825
Ying, you'll have happiness in life.

24:08.425 --> 24:09.385
Yes.

24:12.225 --> 24:13.585
The Blaze Blossom

24:14.425 --> 24:16.385
will bloom.

24:17.105 --> 24:18.065
You…

24:18.585 --> 24:20.185
You know what flower it is now?

24:44.105 --> 24:46.065
Princess Ying is preparing
to awaken the Dual-Pupil Art?

24:48.025 --> 24:48.945
Yes.

24:51.145 --> 24:55.185
I've heard
that art exists only in legends.

24:57.505 --> 24:59.185
Everything is progressing as planned.

24:59.865 --> 25:01.705
The Dual-Pupil Art
is terrifyingly powerful,

25:01.785 --> 25:04.865
and Princess Ying is now
slowly losing her sanity.

25:05.785 --> 25:07.865
She's ready to drag him
down with her if she must.

25:09.985 --> 25:12.545
These past days, I've tampered

25:13.145 --> 25:14.465
with His Majesty's pills.

25:15.065 --> 25:16.385
Just enough to leave him drowsy,

25:16.905 --> 25:18.385
and none the wiser.

25:21.545 --> 25:22.585
But tell me,

25:23.905 --> 25:25.905
has Princess Ying
ever seen your true face?

25:28.705 --> 25:29.585
She shouldn't recognize me.

25:30.825 --> 25:31.705
These next few days,

25:32.225 --> 25:33.545
I'll keep a close watch on her.

25:35.865 --> 25:37.385
POISON TOAD

27:18.145 --> 27:21.905
DEVOID OF DELUSION

27:26.705 --> 27:27.665
Sir.

27:28.425 --> 27:30.265
Everything is prepared.

27:33.025 --> 27:36.745
Are you certain this will cure me?

27:37.745 --> 27:39.025
Madam has said

27:39.625 --> 27:42.905
she'd rid you of your
suffering once and for all.

27:45.105 --> 27:47.465
Very well. Let's begin.

27:48.065 --> 27:49.265
Yes, sir.

28:26.185 --> 28:27.265
You're awake.

28:29.425 --> 28:30.265
How long was I asleep?

28:30.865 --> 28:31.705
An hour.

28:34.105 --> 28:35.945
Your Majesty has been overworked lately.

28:36.025 --> 28:37.625
It's normal to be drowsy now and then.

28:39.385 --> 28:41.345
You summoned Mr. Li Chengtian.

28:41.425 --> 28:42.825
He'll be here shortly.

28:44.345 --> 28:47.505
I'll fetch some Zixue Pills
to help you stay alert.

28:47.585 --> 28:48.425
All right.

28:53.225 --> 28:55.225
You don't know where
Princess Ying has gone?

28:55.305 --> 28:57.425
Her Majesty had
chicken soup prepared for her.

28:57.505 --> 28:58.625
It won't taste good once it's cold.

28:59.385 --> 29:01.105
I really don't know.

29:01.185 --> 29:03.025
Lately, the princess
has stayed in her chamber.

29:03.105 --> 29:04.625
No one is allowed in.

29:04.705 --> 29:06.385
But today, for some
reason, she's not there.

29:06.985 --> 29:08.225
We're searching as well.

29:08.745 --> 29:11.745
It's fine.
We'll wait for her in her chamber, then.

29:11.825 --> 29:12.785
She'll return eventually.

29:12.865 --> 29:13.825
Your Majesty,

29:13.905 --> 29:15.705
the princess
forbids lighting a fire inside.

29:15.785 --> 29:17.425
It's a bit cold within.

29:18.625 --> 29:19.745
It's all right.

29:27.345 --> 29:28.385
Your Majesty.

29:34.185 --> 29:35.225
Ying.

29:40.225 --> 29:42.025
Ying. Why are you here?

29:42.825 --> 29:44.465
Did you find Hongqing?

29:46.865 --> 29:47.705
Not yet.

29:48.345 --> 29:49.385
But I haven't given up.

29:50.225 --> 29:52.065
The fact that we haven't found his body

29:52.745 --> 29:55.145
also proves
that Li Hongqing is still alive.

29:56.505 --> 29:57.505
You're lying to me.

29:59.265 --> 30:00.185
I'm not.

30:01.945 --> 30:04.865
Is it because
you hate seeing me in love with Hongqing?

30:04.945 --> 30:07.305
Did you send him to his death?
Did you want him dead?

30:07.385 --> 30:09.025
I did not.

30:09.105 --> 30:10.145
Why would I do such a thing?

30:10.225 --> 30:11.865
You've never liked
me since we were children.

30:12.625 --> 30:13.945
You wanted me dead.

30:14.545 --> 30:15.865
You wanted the fire to burn me alive.

30:21.945 --> 30:23.985
-Ying, calm down.
-Do not call me that!

30:25.505 --> 30:27.185
Only Hongqing can call me that.

30:30.785 --> 30:32.585
Shall I summon the Prince of Yuzhang?

30:33.545 --> 30:36.265
Believe me or not,
I am your brother as well.

30:36.345 --> 30:38.265
I want you to be happy too.

30:38.345 --> 30:40.385
And I hope that one day

30:40.465 --> 30:41.545
you'll let me care for you.

30:42.745 --> 30:45.025
If Your Majesty truly cares for me…

30:47.985 --> 30:50.305
Promise me one thing, will you?

30:53.345 --> 30:55.465
Certainly. Tell me.

31:01.265 --> 31:03.665
Look at this table. It's so
messy, and no one cleaned it.

31:03.745 --> 31:05.625
These servants all deserve a beating.

31:10.825 --> 31:12.145
Judging by this sight,

31:12.225 --> 31:14.265
the princess hasn't slept in her bed
for quite some time.

31:15.225 --> 31:17.745
The eunuchs said
she'd barely eaten these days.

31:21.825 --> 31:24.185
She stopped eating and
sleeping over Li Hongqing.

31:24.265 --> 31:25.665
If this goes on,

31:25.745 --> 31:26.985
it will take a toll on her body.

31:29.065 --> 31:30.585
And who knows what she does

31:31.105 --> 31:32.705
when shut up in here all day.

31:38.745 --> 31:40.225
Something here has been moved.

31:43.065 --> 31:44.665
Why would she shift the carpet?

32:01.545 --> 32:02.385
Your Majesty!

32:02.465 --> 32:03.705
The figure wearing the crown

32:03.785 --> 32:05.665
is His Majesty?

32:10.905 --> 32:11.945
Guards!

32:13.185 --> 32:15.345
-Your Majesty.
-Where is His Majesty now?

32:15.425 --> 32:16.545
Likely in Wuying Hall.

32:17.225 --> 32:18.425
Notify General Lu.

32:18.505 --> 32:19.825
Deliver my decree.
Summon the Prince of Yuzhang.

32:19.905 --> 32:21.505
The rest of you,
come with me to Wuying Hall.

32:21.585 --> 32:22.425
Yes.

32:23.665 --> 32:24.865
Your Majesty!

32:26.345 --> 32:27.265
It's alright.

32:42.505 --> 32:44.065
Just die,

32:45.065 --> 32:45.985
all right?

33:12.465 --> 33:14.065
Die!

33:22.865 --> 33:25.425
Your Majesty! Princess Ying!

33:25.505 --> 33:26.785
Stop at once!

33:29.825 --> 33:32.945
-General Lu!
-General Lu!

33:33.545 --> 33:35.305
-Are you injured?
-General Lu!

33:35.385 --> 33:36.825
Don't come any closer!

33:40.745 --> 33:41.745
The Empress?

33:44.465 --> 33:46.505
I think I might like you a little.

33:47.145 --> 33:47.985
Forgive me.

33:52.905 --> 33:54.065
He's the one
Li Hongqing loved and respected most!

33:57.665 --> 33:58.785
No.

33:58.865 --> 33:59.825
The one he loved most was me.

33:59.905 --> 34:01.465
He's followed
His Majesty since he was nine.

34:01.545 --> 34:03.985
If you kill him,
Li Hongqing will never forgive you!

34:16.145 --> 34:17.185
Xiao Ying.

34:17.744 --> 34:20.545
Do you still remember
what Li Hongqing promised you?

34:24.264 --> 34:25.344
If you wish,

34:25.425 --> 34:27.945
I'll take you out of the palace
to see the sea of blossoms.

34:32.545 --> 34:33.865
If I wish,

34:34.744 --> 34:36.625
he'll take me to see the flowers.

34:38.105 --> 34:39.344
That's right.

34:39.425 --> 34:40.865
He promised you

34:40.945 --> 34:42.185
you'd see the flowers.

34:43.065 --> 34:44.985
But if you kill His Majesty now,

34:45.065 --> 34:46.545
that wish will never come true.

34:53.905 --> 34:54.784
Liar.

34:54.865 --> 34:56.304
I'm not lying.

34:57.665 --> 34:59.225
If Li Hongqing stood here today,

34:59.305 --> 35:01.425
he wouldn't want to see you like this.

35:02.025 --> 35:04.065
If you kill the one he respects most,

35:05.065 --> 35:07.505
then you will never see him again.

35:20.345 --> 35:21.225
Shut up!

35:36.425 --> 35:38.665
Your Majesty. Are you all right?

35:47.825 --> 35:48.945
Cangcang…

35:58.425 --> 35:59.385
Cangcang!

36:04.705 --> 36:05.825
-Your Highness.
-Your Highness.

36:06.985 --> 36:08.345
WUYING HALL

36:12.905 --> 36:13.865
Your Highness.

36:14.625 --> 36:16.065
Ying. Ying!

36:17.385 --> 36:18.305
Ying!

36:18.825 --> 36:19.665
Ying, are you hurt?

36:21.345 --> 36:22.385
Ying?

36:33.905 --> 36:34.865
Ying.

36:35.665 --> 36:36.705
Why would you do this?

36:40.905 --> 36:42.065
Tell me.

36:42.825 --> 36:44.225
Why did you do this?

36:50.985 --> 36:51.905
And His Majesty? How is he?

36:52.785 --> 36:54.985
Your Highness, His Majesty is safe.

36:55.065 --> 36:56.825
However, Her Majesty…

37:02.025 --> 37:03.065
I deserve punishment.

37:03.145 --> 37:04.225
Nothing would atone for this.

37:05.385 --> 37:06.345
Where are they?

37:06.425 --> 37:07.265
Sent to Linghe Hall.

37:07.345 --> 37:08.745
Imperial Physician Li is there.

37:10.145 --> 37:11.065
Eunuch Feng and the others

37:11.145 --> 37:12.545
were likely struck by
Ying's Enfeebling Dust.

37:13.225 --> 37:15.265
The cold palace should have the antidote.
One more thing.

37:16.105 --> 37:18.505
If the Empress Dowager arrives,
you must stop her.

37:18.585 --> 37:19.865
Do not let her near Linghe Hall.

37:20.745 --> 37:21.865
Yes.

37:57.945 --> 37:58.785
You brat.

37:59.425 --> 38:01.345
Get some rest.

38:03.145 --> 38:06.145
When will the Empress be out of danger?

38:07.905 --> 38:11.025
Her Majesty
miscarried and lost too much blood.

38:11.105 --> 38:12.345
But her constitution is strong.

38:12.425 --> 38:14.465
If she wakes, she should recover.

38:22.665 --> 38:23.865
And if she doesn't wake?

38:27.945 --> 38:28.825
You brat.

38:29.545 --> 38:31.465
You must keep a clear head.

38:32.385 --> 38:33.265
A clear head?

38:34.425 --> 38:36.585
My child is gone.
My empress remains unconscious.

38:36.665 --> 38:37.505
How do you expect me to be calm?

39:09.305 --> 39:11.865
Now, my child is gone.

39:12.705 --> 39:14.585
The Empress is
bleeding out, clinging to life.

39:15.265 --> 39:16.905
All thanks to your dear little sister.

39:22.305 --> 39:24.625
I deserve a thousand deaths.

39:26.705 --> 39:27.745
You need not die.

39:28.385 --> 39:30.305
But Xiao Ying must pay the price.

39:33.425 --> 39:35.745
It's my fault for failing to guide her.
Punish me instead.

39:35.825 --> 39:37.265
Will you die in her place too?

39:43.225 --> 39:46.105
Your Majesty, I beg you.
Please spare her life.

39:46.985 --> 39:49.145
In return, you will have
my unconditional loyalty.

39:51.985 --> 39:52.945
Get out.

39:53.585 --> 39:55.105
I don't want to see you again.

40:19.065 --> 40:20.425
You brat.

40:20.505 --> 40:22.145
Get some rest.

40:22.225 --> 40:24.465
If Her Majesty wakes up,

40:24.545 --> 40:26.305
you shouldn't be the one who falls sick.

40:27.225 --> 40:28.385
Why isn't the Empress awake yet?

40:29.545 --> 40:31.665
I checked her pulse just now.

40:31.745 --> 40:33.425
It's still steady and strong.

40:33.505 --> 40:35.145
Give her a little more time.

40:47.305 --> 40:48.385
Your Majesty,

40:48.465 --> 40:50.185
Prince of Yuzhang
is still kneeling outside.

40:52.145 --> 40:53.745
Let him kneel all he wants.

41:50.145 --> 41:53.785
LINGHE HALL

42:54.025 --> 42:55.385
Cangcang.

42:58.945 --> 42:59.825
You're awake.

43:01.465 --> 43:02.465
Your Majesty.

43:05.065 --> 43:06.065
Your Majesty.

43:07.985 --> 43:09.345
Were you hurt?

43:11.505 --> 43:12.465
I am all right.

43:13.185 --> 43:14.265
I am safe and sound.

43:18.665 --> 43:20.185
I'm glad to hear that.
